    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glitch Core</strong><br>A realistic, tactical, fast paced FPS Rogue Lite, set in a future where AI is deemed too dangerous for earth.  <br>Where you play as an AI agent on a moon base, training in a ruthless combat simulation to improve your skills, that is, until you find the truth behind your existence....<br><i><br>TLDR:</i><br><u>A casual, action packed rogue like FPS game! <br>Where it's simply fun to shoot things up!</u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439980/extras/b9ec73820169c6f6e816c31bc6c650d7.avif?t=1740817313\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark immersive world design with a hint of procedural generation</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439980/extras/fe8c58a83c31c49355d2e42a1b597125.avif?t=1740817313\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An expansive passive ability skill tree with Glitch Skills and Core Skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439980/extras/ffb4686de71dae00bf7bddb41ca3795c.avif?t=1740817313\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special abilities</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439980/extras/465306539e79e575864360dc4d6e1ffe.avif?t=1740817313\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>over 20 guns, scopes and grenades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439980/extras/7e5ae27515eb16c1e84ad756cee8d761.avif?t=1740817313\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
